- Do you read Newspaper: Possibly unrelated or weakly related.  
- The format used for reading books: "Printed" or "Both" may indicate more serious or academic reading; "E-books" alone less so.  
- Frequency of reading books: "On everyday basis" or "A few times a week" likely correlates with academic reading; less frequent reading less so.

